# Accepted exceptions to the container image vulnerability scan that
# .github/workflows/image_smoke.yaml runs on a pull request and
# .github/workflows/release.yaml runs ahead of a publish.
#
# That scan fails on a vulnerability in the image's OS package layer that is
# HIGH or CRITICAL and has a fix available. An entry here exempts one
# vulnerability id from it, and is a reviewed decision rather than a way to
# quiet a build: write the reason it was accepted and the date it was accepted
# above the id, so a reader can tell an assessed exception from a forgotten one.
#
#   # 2026-01-01: the affected code path is unreachable from either image role,
#   # and the fix is expected in the next base image point release.
#   CVE-0000-00000
#
# Nothing is accepted today.
